WEBVTT

00:31:59.335 --> 00:32:02.046
but marathoners know how to persevere.

00:32:02.070 --> 00:32:04.631
LW: I think everybody would probably like

00:32:04.655 --> 00:32:08.340
to be instantly successful and be revered

00:32:08.364 --> 00:32:11.027
and acknowledged and acclaimed
and all those things,

00:32:11.051 --> 00:32:13.442
but when it happens to you too young,

00:32:13.466 --> 00:32:16.255
it actually can be very damaging.

00:32:16.279 --> 00:32:19.035
At least the people
that I've seen, who, you know,

00:32:19.059 --> 00:32:22.353
they burned bright
and they burned all the way out.

00:32:22.377 --> 00:32:25.163
They didn't understand
that it wasn't going to last forever

00:32:25.187 --> 00:32:26.973
and that they had to keep reinventing

00:32:26.997 --> 00:32:28.664
and they had to earn it again.